    <p>
      The videos you record are <strong>yours</strong> and stay on your device — we
      never receive, access, or upload them. You are responsible for what you film,
      for any consent needed from people who appear in your videos, and for backing
      them up; we are not responsible for recordings lost through device failure or
      deletion.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">3. Ads and the "Remove ads" purchase</h2>
    <p>
      The free version shows ads provided by Google AdMob (see the
      <a href="/apps/lift-recorder/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>). The one-time
      <strong>"Remove ads"</strong> purchase disables them. All purchases are processed
      and billed by Google Play, not by us, and are <strong
        >non-refundable</strong
      > except as required by law or by
      <a
        href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/2479637"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play's refund policies</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl">4. Disclaimer and liability</h2>
    <p>
      The App is provided <strong>"as is"</strong>, without warranties of any
      kind, to the fullest extent permitted by law — we do not guarantee it will
      be uninterrupted, error-free, or that every recording will succeed. We are
      not liable for indirect or consequential damages or for lost recordings.
      Nothing here limits liability that cannot be limited by law, including
      your mandatory rights as a consumer.
    </p>

